WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.757
Kep was still sleeping under the tree.

2
00:00:06.758 --> 00:00:09.374
"Benjamin," Peter whispered.

3
00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.293
"Let's go to the field.

4
00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:22.227
We can play tag now."

5
00:00:22.228 --> 00:00:25.357
The bunnies hopped back to the field.

6
00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:29.559
A lamb followed them.

7
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.905
"Baa!"

8
00:00:32.906 --> 00:00:36.096
"Go away, lamb!" Benjamin said.

9
00:00:36.097 --> 00:00:38.528
"You can’t play with us!"

10
00:00:38.529 --> 00:00:42.149
"Baa!" the lamb said.

11
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.150
It hopped and skipped.

12
00:00:45.151 --> 00:00:49.822
It wanted to play.

13
00:00:49.823 --> 00:00:52.901
Peter saw something across the field.

14
00:00:52.902 --> 00:00:57.312
"Look!" he cried. "The fox!"

15
00:00:57.313 --> 00:01:00.634
"Oh no!" Benjamin said.

16
00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:04.457
"What should we do?" Peter whispered.

17
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:06.926
"Hide!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:06.927 --> 00:01:09.785
The bunnies hid in the tall grass.

19
00:01:09.786 --> 00:01:14.074
But the lamb was still playing.

20
00:01:14.075 --> 00:01:16.702
The fox came closer.

21
00:01:16.703 --> 00:01:19.385
He did not see the bunnies.

22
00:01:19.386 --> 00:01:22.229
But the fox saw the lamb!

23
00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:26.840
"Uh-oh!" Benjamin whispered.

24
00:01:26.841 --> 00:01:29.076
Peter looked at Kep.

25
00:01:29.077 --> 00:01:35.102
The dog was still sound asleep.

26
00:01:35.103 --> 00:01:38.865
Peter gulped.

27
00:01:38.866 --> 00:01:46.895
"We're in big trouble!"

